      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51c9df87e419f3fc",
      "translationZh": "我们希望清晰概述 transformers 支持的每种量化方案的优缺点，帮助你决定应该选择哪一种。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f278f17e93a06196",
      "translationZh": "目前，对模型进行量化主要有两个目的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86d18e814e75b5bf",
      "translationZh": "在较小的设备上运行大模型推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc5c5fc76ad895e7",
      "translationZh": "在量化模型之上微调适配器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "907028d661b739f1",
      "translationZh": "到目前为止，已有两项集成工作完成，并获得了 transformers 的原生支持：bitsandbytes 和 auto-gptq。请注意，🤗 optimum 库也支持一些其他量化方案，但这不在本篇博文的讨论范围内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc8e175aa4212a8",
      "translationZh": "如需进一步了解每种受支持的方案，请查看下方分享的相关资源。也请查阅文档中的相应章节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "596726a49b8214aa",
      "translationZh": "另请注意，下文分享的详细信息仅适用于 PyTorch 模型，Tensorflow 和 Flax/JAX 模型目前不在讨论范围内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
