    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc937b59892604f5",
      "translationZh": "无",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f27f9745d103b221",
      "translationZh": "从基准测试中可以看出，bitsandbyes 和 GPTQ 的表现相当，而在批大小较大时，GPTQ 略快一些。查看此链接可了解这些基准测试的更多详情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "089502922592c7ec",
      "translationZh": "生成速度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bf34b61b2b3183a",
      "translationZh": "以下基准测试衡量了模型在推理期间的生成速度。为便于复现，可在此处找到基准测试脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "377e43a92d441237",
      "translationZh": "让我们测试一下 use_cache，以便更好地了解在生成过程中缓存隐藏状态的影响。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95e9d656b42f4d26",
      "translationZh": "该基准测试在一张 A100 上运行，提示长度为 30，并且恰好生成了 30 个词元。我们使用的模型是 meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6197557fc8384d1c",
      "translationZh": "使用 use_cache=True",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85a55c6af9ecca95",
      "translationZh": "使用 use_cache=False",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "993c848e6e0e8650",
      "translationZh": "从这两项基准测试中，我们得出结论：使用注意力缓存时，生成速度更快，这与预期一致。此外，GPTQ 总体上比 bitsandbytes 更快。例如，在 batch_size=4 且 use_cache=True 时，它的速度是后者的两倍！因此，在接下来的基准测试中，我们将使用 use_cache。请注意，use_cache 会消耗更多内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7975300f01bc46f8",
      "translationZh": "硬件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3868a8a50c4f5b47",
      "translationZh": "在下面的基准测试中，我们将尝试不同的硬件，看看它们对量化模型的影响。我们使用的提示长度为 30，并且恰好生成了 30 个 token。我们使用的模型是 meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eea0aadd2d35e3af",
      "translationZh": "使用 NVIDIA A100：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee90e782ef5df963",
      "translationZh": "使用 NVIDIA T4：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad18672be155a926",
      "translationZh": "使用 Titan RTX：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c4559081d6f5f41",
      "translationZh": "从上述基准测试中，我们可以得出结论：在这三款 GPU 上，GPTQ 都比 bitsandbytes 更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "841ce1ff110b48c2",
      "translationZh": "生成长度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "067ea1739ee5d85f",
      "translationZh": "在接下来的基准测试中，我们将尝试不同的生成长度，看看它们对量化模型的影响。测试在一块 A100 上运行，使用的提示词长度为 30，并改变生成的 token 数量。我们使用的模型是 meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4304018177f3dbb1",
      "translationZh": "生成 30 个 token 时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86c8ba141a5e5cdd",
      "translationZh": "生成 512 个 token 时：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0470d5e2bfa508c",
      "translationZh": "从上面的基准测试中，我们可以得出结论：无论生成长度如何，GPTQ 都比 bitsandbytes 更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "52d4dd021c153171",
      "translationZh": "适配器微调（前向传播 + 反向传播）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5af190407d2a3b1",
      "translationZh": "无法对量化模型进行纯粹的训练。不过，你可以利用参数高效微调方法（PEFT）对量化模型进行微调，在其基础上训练适配器。这里的微调方法将采用一种名为“低秩适配器”（LoRA）的新近方法：你不必微调整个模型，只需微调这些适配器，并将它们正确加载到模型内部即可。让我们比较一下微调速度！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "583eda8b6088bd10",
      "translationZh": "基准测试在一块 NVIDIA A100 GPU 上运行，我们使用了 Hub 上的 meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf 模型。请注意，对于 GPTQ 模型，我们必须禁用 exllama 内核，因为 exllama 不支持微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0d34d5316071fcd",
      "translationZh": "根据测试结果，我们得出结论：在微调方面，bitsandbytes 比 GPTQ 更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5707ae53c9d681f0",
      "translationZh": "性能下降",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e81060314535f0cb",
      "translationZh": "量化非常有助于降低内存消耗。不过，它确实也会带来性能下降。让我们使用 Open-LLM 排行榜来比较一下性能！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80a15f7abcc1efbf",
      "translationZh": "使用 7b 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38ae2c5b84529e8",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0170",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca3ac1adc17ef3e9",
      "translationZh": "使用 13b 模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38ae2c5b84529e8",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4a84b4836f7587c",
      "translationZh": "TheBloke/Llama-2-13B-GPTQ（修订版本 = 'gptq-4bit-128g-actorder_True'）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0201",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df204f899613ddb8",
      "translationZh": "根据上述结果，我们得出结论：规模更大的模型性能下降更小。更有意思的是，性能下降微乎其微！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0202",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c050cb83747a3ed5",
      "translationZh": "结论与结束语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0203",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b046e0b96dc3e397",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们比较了 bitsandbytes 和 GPTQ 量化在多种配置下的表现。我们发现，bitsandbytes 更适合微调，而 GPTQ 更适合生成。基于这一观察，要获得更好的合并模型，一种方法是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0204",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c511b1337af8c70",
      "translationZh": "(1) 使用 bitsandbytes 量化基础模型（零样本量化）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0205",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1423feb51d382f2c",
      "translationZh": "(2) 添加并微调适配器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0206",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "433adcd947987f47",
      "translationZh": "(3) 将训练好的适配器合并到基础模型或反量化后的模型上！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0207",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d721561d49a0012",
      "translationZh": "(4) 使用 GPTQ 量化合并后的模型，并将其用于部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0208",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c665dbb02f08c51",
      "translationZh": "我们希望这篇概述能让大家更轻松地在自己的应用和使用场景中使用 LLM，也期待看到你们会用它构建出什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0209",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0210",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7839e529510eada5",
      "translationZh": "我们要感谢 Ilyas、Clémentine 和 Felix 在基准测试方面提供的帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0211",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "649c6e07eb3cfb91",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们要感谢 Pedro Cuenca 为撰写这篇博文提供的帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
